### ===========================================
### 🔧 DEBUG API TESTS - STEP BY STEP
### ===========================================

### 1. Health Check - Verificar servidor
GET http://localhost:3000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Root endpoint - Verificar rutas básicas
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Registro de usuario DEBUG
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "1debug2025",
  "email": "1debug-2025@example.com",
  "password": "Debug123456!",
  "firstName": "1Debug",
  "lastName": "1User"
}

###

### 4. Login para obtener token DEBUG
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "1debug-2025@example.com",
  "password": "Debug123456!"
}

###

### 5. 🎯 ENDPOINT CRÍTICO - Profile (AQUÍ FALLA)
